    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a colourful journey where puzzle-solving meets exploration in <i>Heave Away Haul Away</i>. Set sail across diverse locations\u2014from lush tropics to scorching deserts and freezing arctic landscapes\u2014and unlock the magic hidden within the world\u2019s vibrant puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique puzzle game, you'll arrange boxes to reveal stunning\u00a0pixel art images. Each completed puzzle brings a satisfying sense of accomplishment, but that's just the beginning. As you explore different environments on your trusty boat you'll discover new challenges, unlocking even more beautiful, intricate designs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Puzzle Solving</strong>: Rearrange boxes to form images which reveal colourful pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sailing Adventure</strong>: Explore breathtaking biomes like tropical islands, endless deserts, and frozen arctic waters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible Coins</strong>: Whilst solving puzzles you'll gather coins to unlock new locations. 150 coins to collect, one as an added challange on each of the 150 puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and Engaging</strong>: A perfect balance of casual gameplay and mind-bending puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you solve all the puzzles and uncover the unique areas across the map? Set sail, start puzzling, and see where your adventure takes you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a colourful journey where puzzle-solving meets exploration in <i>Heave Away Haul Away</i>. Set sail across diverse locations\u2014from lush tropics to scorching deserts and freezing arctic landscapes\u2014and unlock the magic hidden within the world\u2019s vibrant puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique puzzle game, you'll arrange boxes to reveal stunning\u00a0pixel art images. Each completed puzzle brings a satisfying sense of accomplishment, but that's just the beginning. As you explore different environments on your trusty boat you'll discover new challenges, unlocking even more beautiful, intricate designs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Puzzle Solving</strong>: Rearrange boxes to form images which reveal colourful pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sailing Adventure</strong>: Explore breathtaking biomes like tropical islands, endless deserts, and frozen arctic waters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible Coins</strong>: Whilst solving puzzles you'll gather coins to unlock new locations. 150 coins to collect, one as an added challange on each of the 150 puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and Engaging</strong>: A perfect balance of casual gameplay and mind-bending puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you solve all the puzzles and uncover the unique areas across the map? Set sail, start puzzling, and see where your adventure takes you!</p>",
    "short_description": "Cast away on this puzzling adventure. By solving over 150 puzzles you'll arrange boxes into a variety of pixel art images. Each world is a sailing journey to find every puzzle, through tropical paradises to frigid viking villages. Easy to learn, difficult to master.",
